#SKIPTEST
#chip mega328p, 16

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Wait 1 s = 16,000,000 cycles at 16 MHz is over the limit (on a 16F1829 at 8 MHz it is 2,000,000 and fits)
'Expect: compile error (this file is marked #SKIPTEST so the demo sweep ignores it):
'  Repeat For: this Wait is too long to build inline inside the loop body (limit 8,000,000 clock cycles at this clock speed) - use a shorter Wait

#option explicit

Repeat for 5 s
    Wait 1 s
    PORTB = !PORTB
End Repeat
Do
Loop
